# Plain `vp dev` reads `.env`, but it does not provide Cloudflare Durable
# Object bindings. GitHub OAuth, Monkeytype, community mutations, and extension
# pairing require the Worker dev server:
#
#   vp run dev:worker
#
# Put auth secrets in `.dev.vars`, using `.dev.vars.example` as the template.
# Local OAuth callback URL:
#
#   <BETTER_AUTH_URL from .dev.vars>/api/auth/callback/github
# GitHub App workflow events are received at:
#   <BETTER_AUTH_URL from .dev.vars>/api/webhooks/github
# To expose that endpoint to GitHub during local development:
#   vp run dev:webhook
